s/51", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/cb620190/uploads/origins/ca980628-081d-4152-8a4a-bbf12042b3db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=742f8dd834b538e59690a4be3cd5c754", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cb620190/uploads/origins/ca980628-081d-4152-8a4a-bbf12042b3db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=742f8dd834b538e59690a4be3cd5c754, https://si.imgix.net/cb620190/uploads/origins/ca980628-081d-4152-8a4a-bbf12042b3db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c39c27157055d2d3b081dfeaa45b4e1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cb620190/uploads/origins/ca980628-081d-4152-8a4a-bbf12042b3db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=941a03b72a0991110d7fed55dfdadc74 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ポケモンXYのシトロンとユリーカが無数にいて スタンディングオベーションをしてるイラストを描いてください！\n参考\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1gK7PO9PToNr8_qsSSImxn-MPfuTJ9vqc/view?usp=share_link\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/118027079\n\nみんな白熱してるポケモンバトルを見てるって感じですw\n\n\n\nPS.シトロンとユリーカをそれぞれ分けたPSDファイルも作ってください", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kato_siyunn/works/50", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8c5aab26/uploads/origins/478375f6-2428-44df-8dc9-a6185846f1e6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=24ab682fbeeb13123190899f54eecbf8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8c5aab26/uploads/origins/478375f6-2428-44df-8dc9-a6185846f1e6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=24ab682fbeeb13123190899f54eecbf8, https://si.imgix.net/8c5aab26/uploads/origins/478375f6-2428-44df-8dc9-a6185846f1e6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec9a5d9b944a9ecd048a2296e62816ba 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8c5aab26/uploads/origins/478375f6-2428-44df-8dc9-a6185846f1e6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23312aa69f1ea6e